**SECURED** on `e4-gusher-county`, bench seed `e4-gusher-county-01`, trail difficulty — the first era-6 receipt on this map.

## Outcome
- **w12 / 360.000 s / 135 gold / 41 calls**, kills 415, `eventLogHash fnv1a32:a661a965`
- Tape put forward: `attempt-1-tape.json`, declared in `gauntlet-outcome.json`'s `tape` field
